Meanwhile, Federal Judge tosses The Fascist Felon’s $3.8 billion defamation suit against The Washington Post ;
A federal judge in Florida has thrown out the suit, saying that The Fascist Felon “failed to present evidence that would allow a jury to find by clear and convincing evidence”
that The Post “published the allegedly defamatory statements with actual malice.” Another one of TACO'S lawsuits against a news organization has fizzled out...
